 # Changelog
 
+## 0.6.0 — 2026-11-19
+
+- The crawler v0 (`tools/`, `monade-tools crawl run | status`): from the seed authors
+  (`tools/seeds.toml`) to clean texts. Wikidata gives the author, the death year, the
